===================================================================
              Introduction
===================================================================

This directory contains ARM's ARM7TDMI Design Simulation Model.
It is a protected IP model of the ARM7TDMI. 
The accuracy of the DSM is the same as the original Verilog code.

The DSM includes a ModelManager, targeted for one simulator. 

The user will find herein the information : 
     - to setup the DSM environment
     - to test the DSM correct setup using the crftester
     - to use the DSM





